Why this differs from the hardware

The Pulses Plus *hardware* design is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. This software port
is GPL-3.0-or-later instead, because the VCV Rack plugin library does not accept
NonCommercial terms. The two licences cover two different works; neither
constrains the other.

Third-party material

res/BefacoSwitchHoriz_*.svg are derived from the stock BefacoSwitch component
graphics in the VCV Rack component library (rotated 90 degrees by
res-src/rotate_befaco.py), and remain under the VCV Rack component library's own
terms.

Panel label glyphs are outlines of the DejaVu fonts, which are distributed under
the DejaVu Fonts Licence (a permissive, Bitstream Vera-derived licence).
